# slug: ch83-bounded
# source: chapters/ch83.tex:144
# label: alg:ch83-bounded
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch83.tex:147
# caption: Report normalization status independently of the number of performed steps.

REQUIRE finite term, valid rules, nonnegative step budget
ENSURE term, trace, and accurate normal-form status
perform selected steps while both a redex and budget remain
test whether the final term has any selected-strategy redex
IF no redex remains THEN
  return complete normal form and trace
ELSE
  return intermediate term, trace, and incomplete status
END IF

